 opCesh ReyesAlex BabbittLiam Dalton is a New York City based comedian\, act
 or and writer\, born and raised in Queens. His conversational style mixes o
 bservational humor with personal stories of growing up the only boy in a bi
 g Irish Catholic household. Fresh off of performing on Bert Kreischer’s 
 “Fully Loaded“ cruise\, Liam performed on the Impractical Jokers cruise
  and the Netflix is a Joke comedy festival in Los Angeles. He has opened fo
 r big acts like Mark Normand\, Rachel Feinstein and Cipha Sounds. He just f
 inished his stint as a radio personality on New York radio station 94.7 the
  block. When he’s not touring the country or seas\, Liam performs all ove
 r New York City and uploads sketches to his social media daily. Brooklyn na
 tive Alex Babbitt recently made his television debut on HBO’s All Def Com
 edy. When not gracing the stages of NYC's top comedy clubs\, Babbitt's razo
 r sharp wit has made him a favorite on the college circuit\, where he's pac
